# INVWINPW.KEY - a key script of INVWIN, as INVWIN.KEY, run with
# /CFG:PREVW.CFG, a settings file that is not there: the preview's
# loads.  Items > Categories renames item 1's category, and the preview
# shows the new name as the list does, both fetched again as the dialog
# closes.  A new item saved without a location is said to have none; F5
# in its preview, with ESC typed ahead, stops before its notes, and
# ENTER loads it.  Item 3's notes do not fit the preview, which scrolls:
# PGDN and END with the focus in it; having more lines than a memo
# holds, they end with what the item form says of that.  F5 there reads
# the item again, and the ESC typed ahead of its second request stops
# it: the preview says that it did not load, DOWN scrolls nothing, and
# ENTER loads it, as F5 does again; ESC gives the list the focus.  Item
# 3 edited to another category and saved, the preview follows the
# change, and View > Refresh fetches the list and then the preview
# again.  The splitter dragged left narrows the list.  The Find box's
# results for Tandon show item 2 with its preview; DEL from the preview
# deletes it, and the preview is empty and disabled beside the empty
# list, which has the focus.  ESC, and the search dialog's ESC, open the
# item list, two items.  The end by Exit: TEST/GOLDEN/WIN/PREVW.CFG is
# the settings file the drag leaves.  TEST/GOLDEN/WIN/INVWINPW.SNP is
# its snapshot; TEST/framchk.py checks it.
T ADMIN
K TAB
T Retro1986
K ENTER ALT-I C ALT-E
T Computers
K ENTER ESC
S RENAMED
K INS
T S
K ENTER END
S NOLOC
K F6 F5
P ESC
S NLSTOP
K ENTER
S NLLOAD
K ESC UP
S NOTES
K F6 PGDN
S PGDN
K END
S END
K F5
P ESC
S STOPPED
K DOWN ENTER
S LOADED
K F5
S AGAIN
K ESC
S LIST
K CTRL-E
T P
K ENTER
S EDITED
K ALT-V R
S REFRESH
M 220 DOWN MID
M 220 MOVE MID -60 0
M 220 UP MID -60 0
S DRAGGED
K CTRL-F
T Tandon
K ENTER
S FOUND
K F6 DEL
S ASK
K Y
S EMPTY
K ESC
S SEARCH
K ESC
S ITEMS
K ALT-F X
